e same product 1 orders as plan 2. It orders product 0 only every 4 days, which adds roughly 340 in storage and saves only one order day. It also runs short on the day-15 demand spike.\n5. **Plan 6 looks weakest.** It orders every 4 days at about the forecast level, with no buffer. That means many shortages, especially for product 1 on days 17–20 and 25–28, and for product 0 on days 15–18. It also carries the most average stock.\n\nExpected order: 2, 0, 4, 1 in the better half, then 7, 3, 5, 6. Plans 4/1 and 3/7 are close, so those probabilities stay near 0.5."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 4872, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2313, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 4872}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-28T23:00:39.516Z", "request_id": "req_011CgVTuCyWHrmRkFDnM7hYF"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_0133RMXSyGGumvVnKZpR56uR", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgVTuDDdiyjbCDbJRDnit", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_0133RMXSyGGumvVnKZpR56uR", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {"p": [0.75, 0.55, 0.8, 0.35, 0.6, 0.35, 0.15, 0.4]}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 4872, "cache_read_in